WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Light presses, 0.15 to 1.6 N. Top right of the plot: load cell (Fz) and sensor (tactile), in newtons.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Firmer presses, up to about 6 N. The sensor follows the load cell.

3
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:36.000
Hard press. The load cell reaches about 21 N; the sensor stops near 11 N, the top of its range.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Two fingers, over 20 N: outside the calibrated range (shown as "beyond fit").
